(task (id "44892ca0") (title "devex: update of printed (deus view) source is 9x slower than the same code as source (82 s vs 9 s); typecheck re-checks group members ~50x") (state "done") (priority 2) (assignee "") (labels "devex" "perf") (parent "") (details "Compile.typecheck checks members 82745 times for 1616 members on printed source vs 1625 on cat.deus. Found while measuring agent wall time.") (links) (comments (comment "claude" "Cause: JIT replays. Each group's List.forEach ran compiled, a callback's nested callee performed an operation near the end, and the whole forEach replayed (360 replays, 75 s). Fixed in the kernel (D113): calls passing a callback that deoptimized twice run on the machine. 85 s to 10.5 s." (at "1792020717844779000"))))
