(task (id "4a833ce9") (title "deus view output is cut off when piped") (state "done") (priority 2) (assignee "claude") (labels "dogfood" "bug") (parent "") (details "Viewing about 1000 definitions into a pipe stopped after about 1150 lines; into a file it is complete. The kernel probably exits before stdout drains.") (links (def "Cli.view" (ref "566910f6458e430de12fc130964d4a6bfa447ebf8702e0cded2668c37def2e5c"))) (comments (comment "claude" "Cause: the TypeScript host wrote stdout with one writeSync, which a full pipe cuts short (EAGAIN). src/kernel/host.ts now writes until every byte is out. Checked: 485919 bytes through a pipe whose reader waits 2 s, identical to the file; before, 65536.")))
