(task (id "e76e36b0") (title "Catch the R2 remote up with the git export and push it, so threads can start from deus pull") (state "doing") (priority 2) (assignee "") (labels "vcs" "codebase") (parent "") (details "From Dmytro: threads MUST use the codebase as primary VCS, and git as backup. D101. The remote r2://agent-artifacts/deus/explorer-demo was at #5ed10805c0 (stage 65). Pulling it, then update codebase/code codebase/specs, task import and history import gives exactly the export (1727 definitions, 0 differ); the push failed with 403 from this session's network policy for <account>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Run that catch-up from a session that can reach R2.") (links) (comments (comment "claude" "The JS target thread could not reach R2 either: its deus pull origin was refused by the session's permission policy before any request. It restored from the git export and exported back (D102)." (at "1792015385058535000")) (comment "claude" "The explorer graph-view thread (claude/project-thread-oixvu2) has no DEUS_R2_ENDPOINT, so it cannot deus pull or push either; it works on the git export (restore, update, export) until this lands." (at "1792016129694665000")) (comment "claude" "The 'Continue DEUS pending work' thread has no R2 keys. It worked on the git export: D113/D114 and the task restore are on #13952's branch (fb40e15a), ready for the next deus pull/push from a thread that has the keys." (at "1792021279667234000"))))
